#. Tag: title
#: introduction.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr " "

#. Tag: title
#: introduction.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "What is &kappname;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: introduction.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kappname; is a fast and easy to use image viewer for KDE."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: introduction.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It features a folder tree window and a file list window to provide easy "
"navigation of your file hierarchy. &kappname; uses docked windows, so you can "
"alter its layout any way you wish. You can also browse your images in "
"full-screen mode, or embedded within &konqueror; using the Image View and "
"Kpart."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: introduction.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Image loading is handled by the Qt library, so &kappname; supports all image "
"formats your Qt installation supports. &kappname; correctly displays images "
"with an alpha channel as well as animations."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: introduction.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; supports the displaying and editing of EXIF comments in JPEG images. "
"Lossless JPEG transforms such as rotations and mirroring are also supported."
msgstr ""

